on order (`pattern && string` before `regcomp`) preserved.\n\n## Differential test evidence\nA `dlopen`-based harness ran both `.so`s over 36 uname strings (Windows `[Ver: ...]`, Ubuntu/CentOS/Debian/macOS/SunOS/AIX/HP-UX formats, pipe-platform, codename, multi-bracket, empty/malformed), 17 arch inputs, 15 regex cases (including 4 invalid patterns hitting the `stderr` path, NULL args, `nmatch`=0/1), NULL-`osd`, and pre-populated fields:\n\n- **stdout: 437 lines identical**\n- **stderr: 4 lines identical** (`Couldn't compile regular expression '...'`)\n- A separate edge suite covering the heap-underflow cases (`\"x [\"`, `\"x [Ver: \"`) was also **identical**, including the out-of-bounds write's observable effect.\n\n`cargo build --release` compiles with **no warnings**. `c_src/` is untouched (mtimes still 13:17); scratch build dirs were removed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1799,"cache_read_input_tokens":43942,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1799,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f25dbb3c-0f1b-4591-aa98-ba299c5f723a","uuid":"9232e30a-cc92-49f7-a0ce-b87a57a1b754","timestamp":"2026-08-27T13:22:52.919Z"}
